Z||000012||artherd||08-11-2001||07:31 AM||||:)  According to certin 'experts' I am going to end up with a cracked frame/roof/tooth,hoof?&gt;, and a blown up getrag :)<P>We will see soon enough (I hope!)<P>The roof thing is totally bogous, the car is simply brilliant with 17"s!<P>As for the transmission, call me in a year or two, we'll know by then!!! &lt;evil manaical laugh, come here little northstar!!!!!&gt;<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
